{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"北角春秧街大廈單位起火 濃煙衝天 消防拖喉灌救。FB：北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/444de235386c306874bb610d1e668fb0/2026-11/n1.png\"/><p>北角春秧街近北角道一樓上單位，今日（11月16日）下午3時半左右起火，濃煙衝天，火舌冒出窗戶。消防接報趕至，動用一喉一煙帽隊灌救。火警中暫時未有受傷報告，起因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。FB：北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c7d9f69709bf8695aa5da9dfe94c914/2026-11/n3.png\" title=\"消防到場撲救。FB：北角有樂\"/><p>消防到場撲救。FB：北角有樂</p><img alt=\"火舌冒出窗戶。FB：北角有樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fa88a53147eb52d69b0695259744c51/2026-11/n2.png\" title=\"火舌冒出窗戶。FB：北角有樂\"/><p>火舌冒出窗戶。FB：北角有樂</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:54:31.602719+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:44:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:48:07.374480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T07:48:07.374480+00:00","content_hash":"7c7b334e6da1fc1ea88651ba3fb5aeac150045b1e6a316ad2f7594efe2970e42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}